  m_text: 'The cement plant''s emissions have increased significantly over the past
    year. Management knows that emissions are coming from fuel use, electricity consumption,
    and clinker production, but they do not know which source contributes the most
    or where to focus their investments. What should the plant do first to identify
    the biggest opportunities for carbon reduction?

'
