      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '\u2022 Respect & Legacy: He is focused on ensuring his sons are prepared
    to take over the business.

    \u2022 Stability: He requires clear regulatory
    roadmaps to ensure operational consistency as he navigates the decarbonization
    process.

    \u2022 Reputation: As a vital national contributor, he seeks to
    balance his industrial output with responsible decarbonization.

    \u2022 Control:
    He prioritizes proven technologies to safeguard his role as a stable contributor
    to the national infrastructure.'
